# Prettier ignore list for website/ (Astro site).
node_modules
dist
.astro
package-lock.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json

# prettier-plugin-astro cannot parse a `<script>` nested inside a JSX
# expression, which is how the dev-only react-scan block is gated (the gate is
# deliberate — it keeps the tag out of the built HTML entirely). The file is
# still covered by ESLint, `astro check`, and the build; only Prettier skips it.
src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro

# Gitignored scratch space (the durable plan file per ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md);
# never committed, so it should not gate `npm run format`.
tmp

# Gitignored compiler perf trace written by `npm run typecheck:debug`
# (`generateTrace` in tsconfig.debug.json) and read by `npm run trace:analyze`.
# `types.json` runs to hundreds of megabytes, which is enough to OOM Prettier
# outright — machine output, never hand-edited, so there is nothing to format.
trace
